{
  "id": "p9-social-courtship-friendship",
  "title": "第一次照面、友人的周旋与一场回绝",
  "stage": "adulthood",
  "ageWindow": {
    "min": 17,
    "max": 40
  },
  "tags": ["courtship", "friendship", "social", "adulthood", "reputation", "leopoldstadt"],
  "baseRate": 0.22,
  "conditions": [
    {
      "kind": "age",
      "min": 17,
      "max": 40
    }
  ],
  "kind": "event",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "p9-social-courtship-friendship.fasching-dance",
      "title": "狂欢节舞会上的第一支舞",
      "weight": 1,
      "rate": 0.044,
      "conditions": [
        {
          "kind": "age",
          "min": 17,
          "max": 40
        },
        {
          "kind": "notHasRelation",
          "relationKind": "partner"
        },
        {
          "kind": "cash",
          "min": 1
        }
      ],
      "roles": [
        {
          "key": "subject",
          "kind": "subject",
          "required": true,
          "minAge": 17,
          "maxAge": 40
        },
        {
          "key": "partner",
          "kind": "partner",
          "required": true,
          "minAge": 17,
          "maxAge": 40
        },
        {
          "key": "friend",
          "kind": "neighbor",
          "required": true,
          "minAge": 17,
          "maxAge": 45
        }
      ],
      "outcomes": [
        {
          "id": "dance-first-polka",
          "weight": 1,
          "text": "波尔卡重新响起时，{subject}走到靠墙的长凳前向{partner}弯腰。姑母手里的扇子停了停，没说话。入场费和小费一共一克朗，{subject}把找零塞回内袋；一支舞跳完，{partner}说了自己住在哪条街，{subject}把名字和门牌在心里念了两遍。",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "cash",
              "householdId": "$household",
              "amount": -1,
              "reason": "付给乐队的小费与舞会入场费"
            },
            {
              "type": "relation",
              "a": "$subject",
              "b": "$partner",
              "kind": "acquaintance",
              "trust": 0.08,
              "affection": 0.1,
              "obligation": 0,
              "fear": 0,
              "respect": 0.04,
              "reason": "在舞会上跳过一支波尔卡并打听到住处"
            }
          ],
          "narration": [
            {
              "id": "p9-social-courtship-friendship.fasching-dance.dance-first-polka.alt1",
              "key": "dance-first-polka",
              "text": "地板上了蜡，鞋底一滑，{subject}扶了一下椅背才站稳。{partner}低着头，耳根发红；姑母在一旁数着乐队收了几枚铜板。",
              "tone": ["dry"]
            },
            {
              "id": "p9-social-courtship-friendship.fasching-dance.dance-first-polka.alt2",
              "key": "dance-first-polka",
              "text": "小提琴手拉错了一个音，满屋人笑出声。{friend}在人群后头朝{subject}比了个手势，意思是问到了街名；{subject}没有回头，只把舞步又踩准了一拍。",
              "tone": ["matter-of-fact"]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "dance-look-only",
          "weight": 1,
          "text": "{subject}在人群外站到腿发酸，只隔着跳舞的人看了{partner}几眼。散场时{friend}裹着围巾凑过来，{subject}低声托{friend}去打听{partner}的门第和姓氏，自己先出了酒馆，在冷风里等回话；一整晚没敢上前，鞋底粘着酒馆地板的糖渍。",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "mood",
              "personId": "$subject",
              "amount": -0.03,
              "reason": "整晚没敢上前搭话"
            },
            {
              "type": "relation",
              "a": "$subject",
              "b": "$friend",
              "kind": "friend",
              "trust": 0.06,
              "affection": 0.04,
              "obligation": 0.05,
              "fear": 0,
              "respect": 0,
              "reason": "托友人替自己打听对方底细"
            }
          ],
          "narration": [
            {
              "id": "p9-social-courtship-friendship.fasching-dance.dance-look-only.alt1",
              "key": "dance-look-only",
              "text": "{friend}回来时搓着手，说{partner}的姑母是面粉铺掌柜的遗孀，住在斐迪南大街后头的小巷里。{subject}记下这条巷子，回家一路没再说话。",
              "tone": ["dry"]
            },
            {
              "id": "p9-social-courtship-friendship.fasching-dance.dance-look-only.alt2",
              "key": "dance-look-only",
              "text": "衣帽间排了长队，老板娘一盏一盏数着号码牌。{subject}看见那件灰呢外套被人递错了，想开口又咽回去，只把号码牌攥出了汗印。",
              "tone": ["tender"]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "dance-cloakroom-scarf",
          "weight": 1,
          "text": "衣帽间里两条围巾缠在一起，{partner}那条被别人的大衣压住了。{subject}弯腰把围巾抽出来递过去，说了自己每周六在哪家铺子做工。看管费加一杯热茶正好一克朗；{partner}把围巾接过去，没说谢，只问了一句铺子几点关门。",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "cash",
              "householdId": "$household",
              "amount": -1,
              "reason": "衣帽间看管费与一杯热茶"
            },
            {
              "type": "relation",
              "a": "$subject",
              "b": "$partner",
              "kind": "acquaintance",
              "trust": 0.06,
              "affection": 0.06,
              "obligation": 0.03,
              "fear": 0,
              "respect": 0.02,
              "reason": "在衣帽间替对方找回被拿错的围巾"
            }
          ],
          "narration": [
            {
              "id": "p9-social-courtship-friendship.fasching-dance.dance-cloakroom-scarf.alt1",
              "key": "dance-cloakroom-scarf",
              "text": "围巾带着室外的冷气。{partner}把它绕了两圈，下巴埋进去，眼睛却看着{subject}工装袖口上的线头；姑母在门口催了，两人才分开走。",
              "tone": ["tender"]
            },
            {
              "id": "p9-social-courtship-friendship.fasching-dance.dance-cloakroom-scarf.alt2",
              "key": "dance-cloakroom-scarf",
              "text": "{friend}在门外等得不耐烦，把脑袋探进衣帽间，正看见{subject}替人掸围巾上的灰，便咧嘴笑了，回头说自己在街口等。",
              "tone": ["dry"]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p9-social-courtship-friendship.friend-intercession",
      "title": "友人在面包店门口把人拦住",
      "weight": 1,
      "rate": 0.0396,
      "conditions": [
        {
          "kind": "age",
          "min": 17,
          "max": 40
        },
        {
          "kind": "notHasRelation",
          "relationKind": "partner"
        },
        {
          "kind": "hasRelation",
          "relationKind": "friend",
          "minTrust": 0.15
        }
      ],
      "roles": [
        {
          "key": "subject",
          "kind": "subject",
          "required": true,
          "minAge": 17,
          "maxAge": 40
        },
        {
          "key": "friend",
          "kind": "neighbor",
          "required": true,
          "minAge": 17,
          "maxAge": 50
        },
        {
          "key": "partner",
          "kind": "partner",
          "required": true,
          "minAge": 17,
          "maxAge": 40
        }
      ],
      "outcomes": [
        {
          "id": "intercession-formal-visit",
          "weight": 1,
          "text": "{subject}让{friend}换件干净外套，星期天正式上{partner}家去问一声。自己留在家里擦皮鞋、擦窗台，听见走廊有人上楼就站起来。{friend}天黑才回，说对方母亲让等答复，还问起房租和搭伙的事；{subject}等了一整天，茶壶热了三遍，心一直悬着。",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "relation",
              "a": "$subject",
              "b": "$friend",
              "kind": "friend",
              "trust": 0.1,
              "affection": 0.05,
              "obligation": 0.1,
              "fear": 0,
              "respect": 0.05,
              "reason": "托友人正式上门说亲"
            },
            {
              "type": "mood",
              "personId": "$subject",
              "amount": -0.02,
              "reason": "等回话等了一整天，心悬着"
            }
          ],
          "narration": [
            {
              "id": "p9-social-courtship-friendship.friend-intercession.intercession-formal-visit.alt1",
              "key": "intercession-formal-visit",
              "text": "{friend}把帽子捏在手里回来，说对方家灶上正炖着东西，满屋洋葱味。{friend}讲一句停一句，{subject}只好把茶壶又热了一遍。",
              "tone": ["dry"]
            },
            {
              "id": "p9-social-courtship-friendship.friend-intercession.intercession-formal-visit.alt2",
              "key": "intercession-formal-visit",
              "text": "走廊里同住的人探头探脑，问是不是说成了。{subject}只说“等回话”，把门关轻一点，回头见{friend}已经把自己那份面包掰了一半。",
              "tone": ["matter-of-fact"]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "intercession-too-far",
          "weight": 1,
          "text": "{subject}听到{friend}把工钱和家底夸过了头，脸沉下来，当晚就照地址找上门去解释。话到嘴边绕成一团，{partner}的母亲把网兜往桌上一搁，说年轻人有话该早说，不该让旁人来传。{subject}站在门里，名声在面包店门口折了一道，{partner}始终没有出来。",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "reputation",
              "personId": "$subject",
              "amount": -0.04,
              "reason": "亲自上门解释反而显得反复"
            },
            {
              "type": "relation",
              "a": "$subject",
              "b": "$partner",
              "kind": "acquaintance",
              "trust": -0.04,
              "affection": 0,
              "obligation": 0,
              "fear": 0,
              "respect": 0.02,
              "reason": "为友人说过头的话登门解释"
            }
          ],
          "narration": [
            {
              "id": "p9-social-courtship-friendship.friend-intercession.intercession-too-far.alt1",
              "key": "intercession-too-far",
              "text": "楼梯间的灯是坏的，{subject}摸黑上了三层，敲门时指节发疼。门开了一条缝，{partner}站在母亲身后，没有出来。",
              "tone": ["dry"]
            },
            {
              "id": "p9-social-courtship-friendship.friend-intercession.intercession-too-far.alt2",
              "key": "intercession-too-far",
              "text": "回来的路上{friend}追着解释，说面包店门口那几句都是实话。{subject}没停脚，只把外套领子竖起来，夜风灌进领口。",
              "tone": ["matter-of-fact"]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "intercession-concert-ticket",
          "weight": 1,
          "text": "{subject}不再让{friend}传话，托其带去一张星期天音乐会的站票，花了一克朗二十赫勒，位置在柱子后头。票上不写多余的字，只说若不方便，票留着也无妨。{friend}把票揣进衬衫内袋，{subject}则把找回来的铜板一枚枚放进铁盒，等一个回音。",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "cash",
              "householdId": "$household",
              "amount": -1.2,
              "reason": "音乐会站票一张"
            },
            {
              "type": "relation",
              "a": "$subject",
              "b": "$partner",
              "kind": "acquaintance",
              "trust": 0.05,
              "affection": 0.07,
              "obligation": 0.04,
              "fear": 0,
              "respect": 0.03,
              "reason": "托友人送去音乐会票，不再让第三人传话"
            }
          ],
          "narration": [
            {
              "id": "p9-social-courtship-friendship.friend-intercession.intercession-concert-ticket.alt1",
              "key": "intercession-concert-ticket",
              "text": "{friend}回来时票角有点皱，说{partner}接过去看了看，没立刻答，只问音乐会散场大约几点。{subject}把这句话在心里翻来覆去，直到天黑。",
              "tone": ["dry"]
            },
            {
              "id": "p9-social-courtship-friendship.friend-intercession.intercession-concert-ticket.alt2",
              "key": "intercession-concert-ticket",
              "text": "售票处的玻璃窗上贴着节目单，{subject}认不全那些字，只记住有一首波尔卡。找回来的铜板落进铁盒，盒盖合上时响了一声。",
              "tone": ["matter-of-fact"]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p9-social-courtship-friendship.opened-letter",
      "title": "被拆开的信",
      "weight": 1,
      "rate": 0.0396,
      "conditions": [
        {
          "kind": "age",
          "min": 17,
          "max": 40
        },
        {
          "kind": "notHasRelation",
          "relationKind": "partner"
        }
      ],
      "roles": [
        {
          "key": "subject",
          "kind": "subject",
          "required": true,
          "minAge": 17,
          "maxAge": 40
        },
        {
          "key": "partner",
          "kind": "partner",
          "required": true,
          "minAge": 17,
          "maxAge": 40
        },
        {
          "key": "neighbor",
          "kind": "neighbor",
          "required": true,
          "minAge": 18,
          "maxAge": 70
        }
      ],
      "outcomes": [
        {
          "id": "opened-letter-go-downstairs",
          "weight": 1,
          "text": "听了那些话，{subject}坐不住，当晚走到{partner}家楼下，请看门人把原信送上去，自己站在门洞里等。看门人下来时手里拿着那封信，信封还是拆开的，说楼上让有话当面讲，不隔着人传。{subject}把帽子捏来捏去，与{neighbor}之间也添了一层不自在。",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "relation",
              "a": "$subject",
              "b": "$neighbor",
              "kind": "acquaintance",
              "trust": -0.05,
              "affection": -0.04,
              "obligation": 0,
              "fear": 0,
              "respect": 0,
              "reason": "邻居拆信传话惹出误会"
            },
            {
              "type": "relation",
              "a": "$subject",
              "b": "$partner",
              "kind": "acquaintance",
              "trust": 0.03,
              "affection": 0.04,
              "obligation": 0.03,
              "fear": 0,
              "respect": 0.05,
              "reason": "坚持把原信送到对方家里"
            }
          ],
          "narration": [
            {
              "id": "p9-social-courtship-friendship.opened-letter.opened-letter-go-downstairs.alt1",
              "key": "opened-letter-go-downstairs",
              "text": "门洞里的墙皮往下掉渣，{subject}把帽子捏来捏去。看门人第二次下来时多问了一句：要不要明早再来听回话。",
              "tone": ["dry"]
            },
            {
              "id": "p9-social-courtship-friendship.opened-letter.opened-letter-go-downstairs.alt2",
              "key": "opened-letter-go-downstairs",
              "text": "楼上窗户开了半扇，有人在抖桌布。{subject}退到街对面，看见信封的影子在窗帘后头晃了一下，又缩回去。",
              "tone": ["matter-of-fact"]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "opened-letter-cold-reply",
          "weight": 1,
          "text": "{subject}信了听来的话，把回信写得又短又冷，只问对方家里到底嫌哪一样，写完封了口，第二天一早塞进街角的邮筒。此后走廊里碰见{neighbor}，两边都只点头，话绕开信的事走；{subject}与{partner}之间那点热乎气，也被这四行字压凉了。",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "mood",
              "personId": "$subject",
              "amount": -0.06,
              "reason": "赌气写了冷淡的回信"
            },
            {
              "type": "relation",
              "a": "$subject",
              "b": "$partner",
              "kind": "acquaintance",
              "trust": -0.06,
              "affection": -0.03,
              "obligation": 0,
              "fear": 0,
              "respect": 0,
              "reason": "回信写得冷淡，两人之间起了隔阂"
            }
          ],
          "narration": [
            {
              "id": "p9-social-courtship-friendship.opened-letter.opened-letter-cold-reply.alt1",
              "key": "opened-letter-cold-reply",
              "text": "信纸是从账本上撕下来的，边缘不齐。{subject}写废了两张，最后只留下四行字，墨迹在“工钱”两字上洇开一小团。",
              "tone": ["dry"]
            },
            {
              "id": "p9-social-courtship-friendship.opened-letter.opened-letter-cold-reply.alt2",
              "key": "opened-letter-cold-reply",
              "text": "邮筒口很窄，信塞进去时卡了一下。{subject}用拇指把信角按平，退开两步，看邮差下午会不会来开箱。",
              "tone": ["matter-of-fact"]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "opened-letter-church-steps",
          "weight": 1,
          "text": "{subject}请同住的{neighbor}跑一趟，把{partner}约到教堂前的台阶上。石台阶还带着晨露，两人各占一级，把原信从头念完；念到“工钱”那处，{partner}说那是家里人的意思，不是自己的话。{subject}把信纸折回原样，至少这一回没有隔着别人传话。",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "relation",
              "a": "$subject",
              "b": "$neighbor",
              "kind": "acquaintance",
              "trust": 0.04,
              "affection": 0.02,
              "obligation": 0.03,
              "fear": 0,
              "respect": 0.02,
              "reason": "请邻居跑腿约人"
            },
            {
              "type": "relation",
              "a": "$subject",
              "b": "$partner",
              "kind": "acquaintance",
              "trust": 0.07,
              "affection": 0.06,
              "obligation": 0,
              "fear": 0,
              "respect": 0.03,
              "reason": "在教堂台阶上当面把信读完"
            }
          ],
          "narration": [
            {
              "id": "p9-social-courtship-friendship.opened-letter.opened-letter-church-steps.alt1",
              "key": "opened-letter-church-steps",
              "text": "教堂的钟敲了八下，鸽子扑棱棱从檐下飞起来。{partner}把信纸折回原样，指甲在折痕上压了压，没有立刻还回来。",
              "tone": ["tender"]
            },
            {
              "id": "p9-social-courtship-friendship.opened-letter.opened-letter-church-steps.alt2",
              "key": "opened-letter-church-steps",
              "text": "{neighbor}把人带到就退到街角，假装看橱窗。台阶上只剩两个人，信纸边角被晨风吹得直翻，{subject}伸手按住。",
              "tone": ["dry"]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p9-social-courtship-friendship.rival-at-table",
      "title": "骑自行车来的另一位客人",
      "weight": 0.9,
      "rate": 0.0352,
      "conditions": [
        {
          "kind": "age",
          "min": 17,
          "max": 40
        },
        {
          "kind": "notHasRelation",
          "relationKind": "partner"
        }
      ],
      "roles": [
        {
          "key": "subject",
          "kind": "subject",
          "required": true,
          "minAge": 17,
          "maxAge": 40
        },
        {
          "key": "partner",
          "kind": "partner",
          "required": true,
          "minAge": 17,
          "maxAge": 40
        },
        {
          "key": "neighbor",
          "kind": "neighbor",
          "required": true,
          "minAge": 18,
          "maxAge": 45
        }
      ],
      "outcomes": [
        {
          "id": "rival-stay-for-cake",
          "weight": 1,
          "text": "{subject}坐回旧椅子，把点心吃完，还添了一次咖啡，咖啡钱和小费一共六十赫勒。临走时当着主人的面问{partner}下星期天去不去普拉特，说可以租条船，船钱自己出。钢琴声停了一下，那位穿硬领的客人低头理了理袖口，{neighbor}的客气里也多了点凉意。",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "cash",
              "householdId": "$household",
              "amount": -0.6,
              "reason": "添咖啡时放在桌上的小费"
            },
            {
              "type": "relation",
              "a": "$subject",
              "b": "$partner",
              "kind": "acquaintance",
              "trust": 0.05,
              "affection": 0.08,
              "obligation": 0.05,
              "fear": 0,
              "respect": 0.04,
              "reason": "当面约对方去普拉特"
            },
            {
              "type": "relation",
              "a": "$subject",
              "b": "$neighbor",
              "kind": "rival",
              "trust": -0.04,
              "affection": -0.06,
              "obligation": 0,
              "fear": 0,
              "respect": 0.02,
              "reason": "与骑自行车来的客人当面较劲"
            }
          ],
          "narration": [
            {
              "id": "p9-social-courtship-friendship.rival-at-table.rival-stay-for-cake.alt1",
              "key": "rival-stay-for-cake",
              "text": "旧椅子的藤面陷下去一块，{subject}坐得比谁都直。糖果盒传过来时{subject}拈了一块，糖纸捏在掌心，没扔。",
              "tone": ["dry"]
            },
            {
              "id": "p9-social-courtship-friendship.rival-at-table.rival-stay-for-cake.alt2",
              "key": "rival-stay-for-cake",
              "text": "那位客人的自行车靠在院墙边，车铃被风吹得碰了一下，响半声。{partner}的母亲往窗外看了一眼，回头给各人续了热水。",
              "tone": ["matter-of-fact"]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "rival-leave-flowers",
          "weight": 1,
          "text": "{subject}把带来的那束便宜紫罗兰搁在门边的小桌上，说工坊还有活，先走了。出门时正碰见{neighbor}在院子里擦自行车，两人客气地让了让路，谁也没先开口。紫罗兰用报纸裹着，花头朝着屋里；第二天{subject}没有再登门，{partner}也没有来问。",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "mood",
              "personId": "$subject",
              "amount": -0.05,
              "reason": "看见对手受礼遇，心里不是滋味"
            },
            {
              "type": "relation",
              "a": "$subject",
              "b": "$partner",
              "kind": "acquaintance",
              "trust": 0,
              "affection": -0.03,
              "obligation": 0,
              "fear": 0,
              "respect": 0.02,
              "reason": "放下花就走，没留下吃饭"
            }
          ],
          "narration": [
            {
              "id": "p9-social-courtship-friendship.rival-at-table.rival-leave-flowers.alt1",
              "key": "rival-leave-flowers",
              "text": "绳结打在花茎上，{subject}把它搁正，花头朝着屋里。转身时听见钢琴又响起来，弹的是一支叫不出名字的曲子。",
              "tone": ["dry"]
            },
            {
              "id": "p9-social-courtship-friendship.rival-at-table.rival-leave-flowers.alt2",
              "key": "rival-leave-flowers",
              "text": "院门开合时铰链叫了一声。{neighbor}手里的抹布停在车梁上，{subject}点了个头，脚步没停，走到街角才把报纸团扔进沟里。",
              "tone": ["matter-of-fact"]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "rival-ask-around",
          "weight": 1,
          "text": "{subject}没有当场争，只在回去的路上向熟人打听那位助理在区公所拿多少薪水、住哪条街。听说对方按月领钱、家里还有老宅，{subject}算了算自己的工钱，第二天到铺子里问师傅能不能多排几个晚班；比较之下，工钱薄得像一张纸，但也学会了先把账问清再开口。",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "skill",
              "personId": "$subject",
              "skill": "social",
              "amount": 0.03,
              "reason": "向熟人打听对手的底细"
            },
            {
              "type": "mood",
              "personId": "$subject",
              "amount": -0.04,
              "reason": "比较之下觉得自己的工钱薄"
            },
            {
              "type": "relation",
              "a": "$subject",
              "b": "$neighbor",
              "kind": "rival",
              "trust": 0,
              "affection": -0.04,
              "obligation": 0,
              "fear": 0,
              "respect": 0.05,
              "reason": "暗中打听对手的薪水和住处"
            }
          ],
          "narration": [
            {
              "id": "p9-social-courtship-friendship.rival-at-table.rival-ask-around.alt1",
              "key": "rival-ask-around",
              "text": "面包铺柜台后的女人一边找零一边说，那年轻人是区公所里抄写文书的，穿硬领不奇怪。{subject}把铜板收好，问的是另一件事：铺子里招不招夜工。",
              "tone": ["dry"]
            },
            {
              "id": "p9-social-courtship-friendship.rival-at-table.rival-ask-around.alt2",
              "key": "rival-ask-around",
              "text": "巷口有人蹲着修鞋，{subject}递了根烟，话题从天气绕到区公所的工钱。烟抽完，{subject}知道了对方住哪条街，也知道了自己差在哪。",
              "tone": ["matter-of-fact"]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p9-social-courtship-friendship.kahlenberg-sunday",
      "title": "星期天的卡伦山",
      "weight": 1,
      "rate": 0.0352,
      "conditions": [
        {
          "kind": "age",
          "min": 17,
          "max": 40
        },
        {
          "kind": "notHasRelation",
          "relationKind": "partner"
        },
        {
          "kind": "cash",
          "min": 4
        }
      ],
      "roles": [
        {
          "key": "subject",
          "kind": "subject",
          "required": true,
          "minAge": 17,
          "maxAge": 40
        },
        {
          "key": "partner",
          "kind": "partner",
          "required": true,
          "minAge": 17,
          "maxAge": 40
        },
        {
          "key": "friend",
          "kind": "neighbor",
          "required": true,
          "minAge": 17,
          "maxAge": 45
        }
      ],
      "outcomes": [
        {
          "id": "kahlenberg-soda",
          "weight": 1,
          "text": "到了观景台，{subject}请{partner}和{friend}各喝一瓶汽水，回程的电车票也一并买了，三瓶汽水和三张票一共两克朗四十赫勒。{partner}把空瓶放回木架，说下回该由自己带水；{friend}起瓶塞时溅了一手，三个人都笑了。",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "cash",
              "householdId": "$household",
              "amount": -2.4,
              "reason": "山顶汽水与回程电车票"
            },
            {
              "type": "relation",
              "a": "$subject",
              "b": "$partner",
              "kind": "acquaintance",
              "trust": 0.06,
              "affection": 0.08,
              "obligation": 0.05,
              "fear": 0,
              "respect": 0.04,
              "reason": "在卡伦山上请客并一同乘车回城"
            },
            {
              "type": "relation",
              "a": "$subject",
              "b": "$friend",
              "kind": "friend",
              "trust": 0.04,
              "affection": 0.03,
              "obligation": 0.02,
              "fear": 0,
              "respect": 0.02,
              "reason": "请同行的友人喝汽水"
            }
          ],
          "narration": [
            {
              "id": "p9-social-courtship-friendship.kahlenberg-sunday.kahlenberg-soda.alt1",
              "key": "kahlenberg-soda",
              "text": "汽水是从木箱里现捞的，瓶身上还挂着水珠。{friend}起瓶塞时溅了一手，笑着说这比在工坊里喝凉水强。",
              "tone": ["tender"]
            },
            {
              "id": "p9-social-courtship-friendship.kahlenberg-sunday.kahlenberg-soda.alt2",
              "key": "kahlenberg-soda",
              "text": "观景台的风把桌布掀起一角，{partner}伸手按住，另一只手扶着汽水瓶。山下的多瑙河灰蒙蒙的，对岸烟囱冒着细烟。",
              "tone": ["dry"]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "kahlenberg-rain",
          "weight": 1,
          "text": "走到半山就落雨，三人挤进酒农的棚子，把篮子里的面包和盐分完，吃食折合一克朗。{friend}把外套顶在头上先跑，{partner}与{subject}留在最后收篮子；雨点打在葡萄叶上，{subject}的鞋袜湿到傍晚，脚趾发麻，谁也没急着走。",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "food",
              "householdId": "$household",
              "amount": -1,
              "reason": "带上山的面包与盐在棚子里分吃了"
            },
            {
              "type": "health",
              "personId": "$subject",
              "amount": -0.02,
              "reason": "淋了雨，鞋袜湿到傍晚"
            },
            {
              "type": "relation",
              "a": "$subject",
              "b": "$partner",
              "kind": "acquaintance",
              "trust": 0.06,
              "affection": 0.07,
              "obligation": 0,
              "fear": 0,
              "respect": 0.03,
              "reason": "在酒农棚子里一同躲雨分面包"
            }
          ],
          "narration": [
            {
              "id": "p9-social-courtship-friendship.kahlenberg-sunday.kahlenberg-rain.alt1",
              "key": "kahlenberg-rain",
              "text": "棚子只有半边顶，雨水顺着椽子往下滴，在地上砸出小坑。{partner}把面包掰成三份，最大的一份推给{friend}。",
              "tone": ["tender"]
            },
            {
              "id": "p9-social-courtship-friendship.kahlenberg-sunday.kahlenberg-rain.alt2",
              "key": "kahlenberg-rain",
              "text": "酒农从屋里探头，问要不要来点热水，{subject}摆手说不用麻烦。篮子底积了雨水，盐包洇湿一角，{partner}把盐拨到干爽处。",
              "tone": ["dry"]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "kahlenberg-silent-return",
          "weight": 1,
          "text": "{partner}与{friend}一路说笑，葡萄园间的路又窄，{subject}走在后头，几次想插话都被笑声盖过去。下山时{subject}不再开口，到了电车站只说自己去买票，把三张票捏在手里一张张撕开，一共九十赫勒；回程的电车晃得人发困，谁也没有再提山顶。",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "cash",
              "householdId": "$household",
              "amount": -0.9,
              "reason": "三张回程电车票"
            },
            {
              "type": "mood",
              "personId": "$subject",
              "amount": -0.07,
              "reason": "觉得自己被晾在一边"
            },
            {
              "type": "relation",
              "a": "$subject",
              "b": "$friend",
              "kind": "friend",
              "trust": -0.02,
              "affection": -0.03,
              "obligation": 0,
              "fear": 0,
              "respect": 0,
              "reason": "回程路上友人只顾与对方说笑"
            }
          ],
          "narration": [
            {
              "id": "p9-social-courtship-friendship.kahlenberg-sunday.kahlenberg-silent-return.alt1",
              "key": "kahlenberg-silent-return",
              "text": "电车来了，{friend}先跳上去占座，{partner}回头招手让{subject}快些。{subject}快步走过去，却在门口停了一下，让两人先进。",
              "tone": ["dry"]
            },
            {
              "id": "p9-social-courtship-friendship.kahlenberg-sunday.kahlenberg-silent-return.alt2",
              "key": "kahlenberg-silent-return",
              "text": "售票员把票钳得咔嚓响，{subject}望着窗外，葡萄园一垄一垄往后退。{partner}问了一句什么，{subject}嗯了一声，没听清也没再问。",
              "tone": ["matter-of-fact"]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p9-social-courtship-friendship.returned-sugar-box",
      "title": "退回的糖盒",
      "weight": 0.8,
      "rate": 0.0264,
      "conditions": [
        {
          "kind": "age",
          "min": 17,
          "max": 40
        },
        {
          "kind": "notHasRelation",
          "relationKind": "partner"
